p stuff. I'd probably just take the same one and delete a bunch of the local references\\n69|and just go find me sponsorship opportunities. Um, I haven't tried something like a Chamber of Commerce\\n70|membership for non-local. Uh, it's still a powerful link, but for local, it makes sense why it's so powerful.\\n71|Um, I don't know if I would like it might be interesting. Certainly worth testing if you know go join 50\\n72|chambers of commerce for your SAS and and see if your rank gets any better. I mean that like 50 of them you\\n73|know most chambers are between $100 and $300 to join depending on the size of the city. So, I mean, you're\\n74|talking it's not that much money, five grand, and yeah, that's a lot, but for a SAS who's like trying to make\\n75|a go of ranking nationally, that's a relatively split testable uh budget to be thinking about. I I would I\\n76|would try it. >> Where do most agencies waste time in local SEO campaigns? >> Uh, writing writing blog posts\\n77|that don't provide topical relevance. Yeah. uh >> talk talk about talk about yeah I I also wanted to ask you\\n78|your thoughts on just like blog SEO and informational keywords and top top of funnel searches but yeah so okay\\n79|they most SEO agencies local SEO agencies are wasting their time on doing blog SEO that doesn't provide\\n80|topical relevance so like what what does that look like? >> Yeah. So a great example again plumbing is if you\\n81|write a blog post top five ways to winterize your water heater right that is not providing topical relevance\\n82|for a plumber who wants to provide plumbing services. So, we had uh a client came to us. Well, a prospective\\n83|client came to us and they wanted local SEO uh a lazy guy surgeon in downtown Chicago and they were getting\\n84|80,000 hits a month from Google search, right? They were paying for SEO and the agency they were paying was,\\n85|you know, objectively doing great. 80,000 is a lot of traffic to come from Google search. But when you went\\n86|and looked uh in the search console to see where they're getting their traffic, it was stuff like, you know,\\n87|top five exercises to keep your eyes healthy or best foods to eat to keep your eyes healthy. It was stuff like\\n88|that. And their rank map for like Lasic Eye Surgery Chicago looked pretty ugly because they were focused on\\n89|theseformational non-local searches. So, when we took over, uh, their homepage had used the word Chicago once\\n90|in the footer for their ad. >> That's crazy, >> right? >> It's insane. Uh, so we obviously rewrote a lot of\\n91|their homepage to focus on Chicago. We started focusing hard on building geographical relevance. So, we'd\\n92|write all this content about these different neighborhoods.\", \"total_lines\": 91, \"file_size\": 9943, \"truncated\": false, \"is_binary\": false, \"is_image\": false}", "tool_call_id": "call_a553a4413d3247eca6205d14", "tool_calls": null, "tool_name": "read_file", "effect_disposition": null, "timestamp": 1787627908.5517635, "token_count": null, "finish_reason": null, "reasoning": null, "reasoning_content": null, "reasoning_details": null, "codex_reasoning_items": null, "codex_message_items": null, "platform_message_id": null, "observed": 0, "active": 1, "compacted": 0}, {"id": 443, "session_id": "20260825_100001_62bb70", "role": "assistant", "content": "", "tool_call_id": null, "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_5430a478bc114b0b896ae921", "call_id": "call_5430a478bc114b0b896ae921", "response_item_id": "fc_5430a478bc114b0b896ae921", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "read_file", "arguments": "{\"path\": \"/tmp/wc_05.txt\"}"}}, {"id": "call_4ef58ead1e4347d3b83e199a", "call_id": "call_4ef58ead1e4347d3b83e199a", "response_item_id": "fc_4ef58ead1e4347d3b83e199a", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "read_file", "arguments": "{\"path\": \"/tmp/wc_06.txt\"}"}}], "tool_name": null, "effect_disposition": null, "timestamp": 1787627913.1539106, "token_count": null, "finish_reason": "too